by Pechynho at 2026-11-16T13:37:06Z

Fine with `noRender()`, I'll rename it.

About the events: I kept `render:started` / `render:finished` firing, so existing listeners (loading states, etc.) keep working the same way, and `backendResponse.isRenderSkipped()` lets a hook know the render was skipped. A dedicated event would force every listener to handle two paths. But if you'd rather announce it explicitly, I can add one.

